diff --git a/plugin/barbershop-core/readme.txt b/plugin/barbershop-core/readme.txt
index 095d313..a0a49a1 100644
--- a/plugin/barbershop-core/readme.txt
+++ b/plugin/barbershop-core/readme.txt
@@ -1,8 +1,17 @@
 === Barbershop Core ===
-Contributors: project-contributors
 Requires at least: 6.6
 Requires PHP: 7.4
-Stable tag: 1.0.0
+Stable tag: 2.0.0
 License: GPLv2 or later
 
-Provides privacy-aware before/after portfolio controls and configurable WooCommerce order alerts.
+WooCommerce setup, short customer registration, persistent cart access, editable product-category icons, order alerts, and privacy-aware before/after portfolios.
+
+== Features ==
+
+* Seeds editable styling, hair-care, and skin-care product categories.
+* Adds a media-library icon field to WooCommerce product categories.
+* Keeps customer registration to name, family name, email, and optional phone.
+* Removes address management from the account profile menu.
+* Adds header and mobile cart access shortcodes with live item counts.
+* Adds a Persian store-setup dashboard for nontechnical daily editing.
+* Requires documented publication permission for before/after images.
